WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.790
Um, first, this is Imber.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.000
He has sort of a mean face,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.790
but he's actually REALLY kind! Also...

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.250
...he's mine and mine alone.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.950
What's in this file?

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:11.370
Are all of these of me?

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:23.330
Um... Thank you, Imber.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:36.790
Sir, here is the paperwork
for the next budget meeting.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.080
Sir?

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.580
Thank you... for your hard work.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:46.500
Sir?!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.910
I've heard the S.O.S.

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:57.830
Have you finally heard it?

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.830
In a cutesy way

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:17.370
Impure or pure, which character?

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.200
Maybe they're the same

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.750
The love beat is opened up full throttle

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.750
I've noticed, this is a special mission... I've got it

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:34.160
I'll show you for real, because I'll make it come true

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:38.040
In a world that's pierced through the skies

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:44.950
I felt a strange emotion, I liked you in an instant!

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:50.040
I'm sure I'll win with a smile

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.370
Sure enough a smile is the right way

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:58.950
I was small and crying but I'll rise to the challenge

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.290
I wonder what this palpitation is

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.580
I need a little medical attention

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:12.660
This feeling of slight fever could be your fault, s.o.s!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:25.500
Ummm, this is from everyone
in maintenance.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:32.290
Thank you, but I am afraid that
I cannot eat that. Please help yourselves.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.500
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:38.830
Hangar Heaven

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.870
Is everyone doing well?

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:42.830
Are they worried about
things with me gone?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.830
S-Sir...

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.830
So then, how about our next date?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.330
Eh?! But we just went there last time!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.580
It lets you level up your muscle power
by 30% in your sleep?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.950
That sounds fishy...

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:01.580
Naturally, I gotta buy it!

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:07.000
Vice Director? Here.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:10.040
It's darjeeling tea. I'm not sure
if you'll like it or not...

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.660
Much obliged.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:20.120
Mmm, I like this flavor.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:23.870
Sweet!

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.870
When do you think the director
will come back?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.750
I'm not sure...

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.450
I hope he gets well soon, don't you?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:40.500
But even though he's gone, things are
about the same as always, aren't they?

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.410
I think that's a bit sad...

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.910
Hey!

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.790
You tfoo! Ftop horffing awound...

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.410
...and give us a hand!

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:59.290
We're going to polish my Nebula
and make him pretty!

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.700
You got that?!

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.250
Iori sure hasn't changed, has she?

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.450
Same goes for Yukiho, huh?

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:16.700
I wonder if Imber would get lonely
if I wasn't around.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:21.200
All righty! We've finished
the frame's final check.

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:25.950
Now then, we're going to break Imber in,
so get the maintenance Eye.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.040
Okay!

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:30.580
Maintenance Eye

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.450
Huh? It's open?

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.750
Okay! Nazuna, let 'im rip!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:39.910
Got it! Activation key for maintenance:
Entering ignition!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.620
Now, then...

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.580
What's that?

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.290
Imber?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.370
Nazuna, what's wrong?

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:59.950
Upperclassman! I didn't do anything!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.160
After I inserted the maintenance Eye,
Imber started to act up!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.500
Nazuna!

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.250
That hurt! What's the big deal?

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.750
Emergency retreat!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.000
Hurry and run for it!

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.080
What is it?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.000
An earthquake?

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.950
Okay, this one is for keeps!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:42.080
Hi, everyone! For this episode of
Yayoi Takatsuki's "Yayoi-style Radio"

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:46.080
we're holding our recording session
from Ginza Satellite Radio for all to see!

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.620
Our guest has a new song
that's selling great!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.620
It's my very bestest friend, Ami Futami!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:55.660
I'm Ami Futami. Hello, everyone.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.660
Eh?! What?! Imber activated on his own?!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.120
Don't tell me it's another outside attack...

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:10.750
It couldn't be! Imber's activation
system is standalone.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.450
It's physically impossible
for that to happen!

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.040
Let's check out the other systems.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.080
Imber...

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.290
What's going on?!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.700
Did you do something weird AGAIN?

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:24.870
Again...? But I didn't do anything!
Did you do something weird AGAIN?

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.080
Again...? But I didn't do anything!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:27.870
Again...? But I didn't do anything!
Hakobe, Suzuna, Suzushiro!

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:29.330
Hakobe, Suzuna, Suzushiro!

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:29.910
Verify the damages.

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:31.660
You sure you didn't push some button
you were unfamiliar with?
Verify the damages.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:32.500
You sure you didn't push some button
you were unfamiliar with?
Got it!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.200
I didn't push anything like that!

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:34.450
Really?

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.330
What's going on...?
Really?

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:36.290
Really!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:36.410
Really?

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.500
Gojo! Serika!
Really?

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.000
Really!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:38.540
Yes!
Really!

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:38.870
Really, really?

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.370
Go ahead and re-check the system.
Really, really?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:41.410
Go ahead and re-check the system.
Really, really!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:42.620
Okay!
Really, really!

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:43.950
You pushed something, didn't you?

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:44.160
I did not!

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:44.830
Ummm...
I did not!

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:45.910
You did!

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:46.910
I did not!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.290
R-retreat!

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.160
Imber!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.660
Now that it's come to this,
I've gotta stop him with Nebula!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.500
I'll sure you how awesome a team...

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:09.660
...Nebula and I make!

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:12.700
I-Iori?!

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.040
Haruka, Imber is...!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.000
An earthquake?

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.450
Earthquakes and cucumbers
are the only things I can't cope with!

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:26.950
Uh, okay...

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.200
Hey, what now?!

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:36.700
The assimilation units! Use their wires!

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:38.660
I'm ready whenever!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:39.830
Yep!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.000
Most impressive!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.750
Firing the wires!

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:52.910
Sweet! Keep that up and tie him down!

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:53.830
Okay!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.080
The wires can't handle any more tension!

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.040
Emergency retreat!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.200
Imber...

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.700
Imber has stopped moving.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.830
Verify the damage.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:31.540
Evacuaate the staff around the hangars
and everyone below Level 3 immediately.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:32.660
R-roger!

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.450
Wh-what should we do, si- Huh?

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:41.330
I'm going to ask the higher-ups
for their opinion. You handle things here!

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.370
He ran away.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.250
Okay, let's begin recording
for the second time!

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:58.000
He isn't moving, is he?

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:02.870
But we can't waltz up to him.
It has become a waiting game, hasn't it?

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.790
It's all my fault! If I had done better...

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:11.660
If you have time to brood, spend it on
figuring out what to do next. Sound good?

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:13.620
Yep!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.750
Sorry for the wait!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.450
Here's a little something!

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:18.910
I've been waiting for this.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:21.450
The results from the simulation are in.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:25.120
This is the supposed damage
the city would take

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.950
in the event that Imber takes the
shortest route to the city's surface.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:32.250
And if Imber activated
his gravitational layer...

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.450
This is serious.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:39.450
Imber has currently stopped moving
and entered idle mode,

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.330
but who knows when he'll start up again?

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.750
Haruka...

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.200
M-maybe Imber wants to go cut loose
and play outside sometimes?

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:56.040
I'm sorry...

00:10:56.750 --> 00:11:02.750
But there is a possibility that Imber
is moving of his own free will, isn't there?

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.000
Imber's will...

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:10.950
Ma'am!

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.750
I have an idea that I would like to try.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.450
Ritsuko...?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.950
Hi, Imber!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.080
All eyes on us!

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:40.410
Please behave yourself, Master.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.750
The Maid Unit has successfully
come in contact with Imber.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.330
They are entering Operation Persuasion.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:53.250
THAT is her "good idea"?

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.500
But it got Imber to stop for the moment.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:59.330
Ah, Imber's sensor is reacting to them!

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.620
Do you think... he's looking at them?

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:03.660
No way.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.290
Next up! Race Queen Unit, mobilize!

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.120
Hi!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.290
H-hi!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.120
Bunny Girl Unit!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.750
Do as we ask... Ba-boing!

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.120
Hi!

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:22.790
Hi!
Hi!

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.160
It's working! It's working!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.750
I figured his No. 1 priority
would be checking out cute girls.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:34.370
B-but... this is really embarrassing!

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:38.370
How could you say that?!
It looks awesome on you!

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:40.370
Be sure to draw Imber's attention!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.410
My girls will secure
the cockpit while you do.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.200
At any rate, if we can just take
the Eye out of his ignition...!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.450
But-

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:54.700
Hey, cut the crap! If Idiot Ribbon's
an angel, why am I THIS?!

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.330
It's okay. You look really great in it!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.620
That's not the point!

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.700
Wh-what is it?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.620
Forehead pissed him off!

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:20.870
Wh-why's it my fault?!

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:26.870
Iori!

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:30.410
Iori!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:33.580
Haruka!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.080
Stop, Imber!

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:38.910
What are you doing, Idiot Ribbon?!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:39.910
Imber!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.000
Are you okay?

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.040
Imber...

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.250
Another earthquake?

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:26.910
He's broken through Partition 7!

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.370
At this rate, he's going
to reach the catapult lane!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:32.080
If he keeps this up, he's going
to damage civilian areas!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.120
Ad-advise people to evacuate!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.660
It won't help. There isn't near
enough time for that.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:40.000
Besides, what would be our pretext?

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.000
We have no choice but to destroy it, huh?

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:46.660
Phew, I finally got the big wigs
to tell me the self-destruct code.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.660
Self-destruct?!

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:52.830
Well, the self-destruct code
really just forces it to lose its frame.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.160
As you can imagine, I can't touch the core.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.080
B-but Vice Director!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.370
So long as the core is safe,
the company is cool.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:05.040
Besides, if we don't stop it in the catapult
lane, which is built to handle explosions,

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:09.500
how will you take responsibility for
civilian casualties when it breaks free?

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:17.910
Please wait!

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:22.290
If we do something about his
activation block, the Eye in his ignition,

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.040
I think that Imber will stop moving!

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.120
So please-!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.000
He's broken through Partition 8!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:40.330
Although it's intermittent, Imber
has initialized his gravitational layer!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.450
It looks like we're out of options.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:48.660
Stop it!

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.330
Oops, you'll have to pardon me.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.830
I was in a hurry, so I took the back route.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:58.870
Sir?!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:04.660
Goodness! Amami and all you ladies
are in rather cute outfits.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.330
Sir, more importantly-!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:12.700
I'm aware. I overheard what is
going on from down below.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.040
Ouch!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:14.540
There is no need to make him self-destruct.
Ouch!

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.290
There is no need to make him self-destruct.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.910
Let's destroy the base instead.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.370
Sir...?

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.200
Put the ultrasonic breaker over here!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.830
Just do it! Bring it just like that!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.000
Transport the X-ray! Hurry!

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:34.200
Okay!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.750
Block E4: Operation complete!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.080
Block D3 is done as well!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.290
But will this really work?

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.580
Our only option right now is to believe...

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:47.790
...in our boss.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:53.080
Here he comes! Everyone retreat!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:53.750
Right!
Here he comes! Everyone retreat!

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:07.080
Imber...

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:15.000
Ignite!

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:33.830
I've been waiting for you...

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:36.330
...you naughty boy!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.200
Now!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.200
I successfully opened the hatch!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.790
Roger! Prepare the ultrasonic breaker!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:55.950
O-okay!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.700
This outfit is heavy!

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:01.000
Moron! You won't be able to
have babies without it!

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:04.910
Move 0.05 to the right!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.910
You went too far. Go back 0.08!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.540
You make it sound so easy!

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:18.910
Iori!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.160
You jerk!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.450
Now!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.290
Target: Confirmed!

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:34.080
Roger! Firing the X-rays!

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.370
Initialize the ultrasonic probe!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:41.120
The diagnosis-er, probe results are in!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.700
Correcting for the margin of error.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.040
The blocks are resonating!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.580
Hurry! I can't keep this up!

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.160
We've identified the diseased part!
Pull the trigger!

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:53.750
Fire!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.160
Imber has shut down!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.000
Core output indicates
that he has entered standby!

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.080
We did it!

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:35.950
I mighta broken it again...

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:02.080
That's our boss for ya!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:05.540
Seriously! I'm amazed
you came up with the idea

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.120
to destroy that one area
with ultrasonic waves!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.330
It was a gallstone.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.790
A gallstone?

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.540
Yes, those can be most painful.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:19.330
I'm sure Imber must feel worlds better now.
By the way, Naze.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.120
Yes?

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.910
I must have put you out while I was away.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.620
No, not at all.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.200
As such...

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.330
please handle the apology letters.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.660
Me again?!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:36.330
To think they directly attacked an iDOL...

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:40.450
So some mice have wheedled their way in.
This will prove troublesome.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:44.250
No, not at all. A lot of the staff
seems rather gifted.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:47.450
We'll effectively stamp them out. Right?

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.330
Prep's all done here!
We're ready whenever.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:09.290
The logs and caches from when Imber
was running amok are gone.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.000
Jeez! What the heck happened?

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:14.910
Huh? Something wrong?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.620
No, it's nothing.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:20.330
Really? Then I'm going to run another
check, so hang tight for a bit.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:21.790
Oh, okay!

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:32.580
Chihaya? But why?

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.790
Imber, let's work together!

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:40.080
Why...?

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.660
Imber?

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:49.580
Huh? Ribbon, the test isn't done yet!

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.700
What gives? Did something happen?
Hey, Ribbon!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:05.200
Like a saint that crosses the ages

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:14.200
In what kind of loneliness did you cry?

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:23.080
Stretching out to a star so far away

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:31.620
Say, I'll depict my feelings, look up at the sky

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:43.080
Dear boy, if I always look for you in my heart

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:52.040
Ah, I'll release a light so strong it will envelop you

00:22:52.040 --> 00:23:01.000
That sparkling trail will be the guide for us both

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:12.580
Now, no matter where we look, we feel the truth

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:40.950
Preview
iDOL and Idol

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:29.790
Uh, the seven members of the
maintenance team are Suzushiro,

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:34.330
Nazuna, Gojo, Hotoke, Serika,
Hakobe, and who's left?

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:35.830
It's me! Me!

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:36.700
Um...

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:38.580
Now then, what is my name?

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:40.250
You should be able to figure it out
with a bit of work!
